# Simplify / current tools first

Follow the escalation ladder (0 eliminate → 9 new software).  
Before Level 9 or AI levels, check simplification, roles, training, configuration, reporting, workflows, integrations, and native automation.  
Use current vendor documentation for material capability claims — not memory.  
Recommend only what James can implement and support.

See `owner-ops/docs/peacemakers-operating-system/TECHNOLOGY_DECISION_STANDARD.md` and `owner-ops/docs/future-recommendation-philosophy.md`.
